title: A mug for the watch
from: Tomas Lind
gist: You took Tomas a mug of Line punch at his watch post.
== lines
tomas: You brought it up. Nobody brings things to the watch.   [laugh]
tomas: It's green. Why is it green? Don't tell me. I'm drinking it anyway.
tomas: Tell me one thing. Just one. Then I have to look at the screen again.   [listen]
